 nd the presumed renaissance of philosophy and the sciences in the Arab wor
 ld enabled by the Greek-to-Arabic translation movement in ninth- and tenth
 -century Baghdad. This talk will re-examine these scholarly assessments by
 \n\nAges: All ages\nLast synced: 2026-11-18 13:08 PST
