DESCRIPTION:Abstract: This talk examines canon dynamics in the Princeton P
 rosody Archive (PPA)\, a collection of over three centuries of writing abo
 ut verse\, pronunciation\, and poetic form. Using neural entity linking\, 
 biographical metadata\, and large-scale text-reuse detection\, we trace th
 e poets and poems that recur in prosodic discourse and ask how particular 
 writers and their poetry became usable as examples in teaching about verse
 . The project raises questions that are as methodological as they are hist
 \n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://cesta.stanford.edu\nLast synced: 2026-
