 isk (co-authored with Levi Crews\, Christian Hilgemann\, Alice Schmitz\, a
 nd Stephanie Stewart)\n\nThis paper evaluates how trade integration affect
 s reliable access to affordable food. We start by showing that countries r
 espond to domestic weather shocks by importing more food from existing sou
 rces\, but not by adding new trade partners\, suggesting adjustment fricti
 ons in import sourcing networks. Consistent with this\, shocks to agricult
 ur\n\nAges: All ages\nLast synced: 2026-11-18 13:08 PST
