 onstitutionality. Professor Rebouche\, Professor at The University of Texa
 s School of Law\, is a leading scholar in reproductive health. She serves 
 as the faculty lead of the Sissy Farenthold Reproductive Justice Defense P
 roject and regularly contributes to legal journals and national media cove
 \n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://law.stanford.edu/event/if-when-how-lun
 ch-talk-on-shield-laws-with-professor-rebouche/\nLast synced: 2026-11-18 1
