 aint is filed? Cooley IP litigators (and SLS alumni) Dan Knauss\, Allie Le
 eper\, and Juan Pablo Gonzalez will trace patent and trade secret litigati
 on through fact and expert discovery\, summary judgment\, and trial. They 
